      "content": "It's more than just enduring it. I can hear their boots on the gravel. They're going to take us alive, and they're going to make us suffer for what happened. I've spent my whole life bound by a code, and now that code is just a joke. Is there any dignity left to me, or is it better to just end it here before they reach us?",
